  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Nor Ukr Professional adaptation integration into the state system</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the project is the integration of the model of professional retraining and social adaptation of veterans, carried out by the Ukraine-Norway project in the period 2003-2019, into the state system. This involves coordination with Ukrainian ministeries, especially Ministry of Veterans Affairs.</narrative>
  </description>
